# pnpm monorepo

## Package manager

- Use **pnpm only** (`pnpm add`, `pnpm install`, `pnpm --filter`)
- Internal dependencies: `"workspace:*"`
- Node: `>=24` (see root `engines`)

## Installing dependencies

Install where they are used, not at the root (except repo tools like turbo, prettier):

```bash
pnpm add <pkg> --filter @repo/ui
pnpm add -D <pkg> --filter web
```

## Workspace packages

| Package | Role |
|---------|------|
| `@repo/ui` | React design system (JIT internal package) |
| `@repo/eslint-config` | Shared ESLint configs |
| `@repo/typescript-config` | Shared tsconfig |
| `@repo/prettier-config` | Shared Prettier config |

## Internal package imports

```tsx
import { Button } from "@repo/ui/button";
```

Never use relative paths across package boundaries.
